Description: Files, the Raye file explorer
 Files is where you keep your documents, pictures, downloads and drives.
 It opens on Home, with the folders you use most and the files you had
 open last, and it shows your drives and network places the way the rest
 of Raye does.
 .
 Tabs across the top, an address bar you can type a path into, a command
 bar with the actions that fit what you picked, a details pane and a
 preview pane, and archives that open like folders.
